                                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-3">You can quickly log out from all sessions using the emergency logout button or the keyboard shortcut Ctrl+Alt+L</p>
                                    <button class="w-full bg-red-600 text-white rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-sm">
                                        <i class="fas fa-power-off mr-2"></i>
                                        Emergency Logout
